    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From princess to queen, facing numerous calculations, step by step in love, encountering hundreds of characters with different personalities one after another, including arrogant young man, gentle childhood sweetheart, mysterious boy, black-bellied fox... How should you choose when your fate is intertwined? Ups and downs of the plot, splendid clothes, managing the imperial city, farming and raising children. &quot;Queen, Please Train Your Male Pet&quot; takes you into a gorgeous and dreamy Chinese style world, composing this love song of troubled times intertwined with heartbeats and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2740 Qingluan prosperous age, prosperous appointment, an ups and downs, beautiful and romantic ancient style journey, invite you to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Ups and downs of the plot, multiple branch immersive experience]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love and kill, sweet and cruel. The monarch's biography, a large number of random event libraries, white moonlight or hard to let go? Be or he? Or a relaxing and healing daily life? You can find it here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818080/extras/3e3c99e4b2203e9723e84bd64a4c331c.poster.avif?t=1755576969\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818080/extras/3e3c99e4b2203e9723e84bd64a4c331c.webm?t=1755576969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818080/extras/3e3c99e4b2203e9723e84bd64a4c331c.mp4?t=1755576969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Only Chinese style, hundreds of illustrations to cultivate]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super-high-precision Chinese style illustrations, dozens of bloodlines such as various schools of thought, solar terms, food gods, scenic spots, intangible cultural heritage, etc., heart-warming servants are always with you, and the exclusive plot is immersive, creating a Chinese romantic Chinese style world for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818080/extras/d1d5e857d60856df8e53635b83067f45.poster.avif?t=1755576969\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818080/extras/d1d5e857d60856df8e53635b83067f45.webm?t=1755576969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818080/extras/d1d5e857d60856df8e53635b83067f45.mp4?t=1755576969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gorgeous outfits, a variety of styles to choose from]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The brocade and embroidery clothes are split into multiple parts, and a variety of styles can be freely matched. Not only can you customize the matching fashion, but you can also challenge the dungeon, get blueprints, make your favorite clothes, and enjoy the dual fun of changing clothes and designing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818080/extras/13bda325e2364460c60e11ba1dd9e32b.poster.avif?t=1755576969\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818080/extras/13bda325e2364460c60e11ba1dd9e32b.webm?t=1755576969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818080/extras/13bda325e2364460c60e11ba1dd9e32b.mp4?t=1755576969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Simulation business, trade and commerce to grow bigger and stronger]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform into a career-oriented heroine, expand land, build workshops, produce goods, complete orders, trade with all corners of the world, and manage the barren imperial city into a prosperous capital. Lord, let's grow bigger and stronger together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818080/extras/74598b55f0677d796587cc247dadaa42.poster.avif?t=1755576969\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818080/extras/74598b55f0677d796587cc247dadaa42.webm?t=1755576969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818080/extras/74598b55f0677d796587cc247dadaa42.mp4?t=1755576969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
